#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "Socks"
msgstr "socks"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid "&Enable SOCKS support"
msgstr "aktiveer socks ondersteun"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid ""
"Check this to enable SOCKS4 and SOCKS5 support in KDE applications and I/O "
"subsystems."
msgstr ""
"bevestig hierdie aan aktiveer socks4 en socks5 ondersteun in kde programme "
"en i/o substelsels."

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid "SOCKS Implementation"
msgstr "socks implementering"

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "A&uto detect"
msgstr "outo verklik"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"If you select Autodetect, then KDE will automatically search for an "
"implementation of SOCKS on your computer."
msgstr ""
"as jy kies outospeur, dan word kde sal automaties soektog vir 'n "
"implementering van socks op jou rekenaar."

#: rc.cpp:7
#, fuzzy
msgid "&NEC SOCKS"
msgstr "gebruik nec socks"

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid "This will force KDE to use NEC SOCKS if it can be found."
msgstr "hierdie sal forseer kde aan gebruik nec socks as dit kan wees gevind."

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid "Use &custom library"
msgstr "gebruik pasmaak biblioteek"

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid ""
"Select custom if you wish to use an unlisted SOCKS library. Please note that "
"this may not always work as it depends on the API of the library which you "
"specify (below)."
msgstr ""
"kies pasmaak as jy wens aan gebruik 'n ongelyste socks biblioteek. asseblief "
"nota wat hierdie dalk mag nie altyd werk as dit hang af op die api van die "
"biblioteek wat jy spesifiseer (onder)."

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid "&Path:"
msgstr "gids soeklys:"

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "Enter the path to an unsupported SOCKS library."
msgstr "invoer die gids soeklys aan 'n nie ondersteunde socks biblioteek."

#: rc.cpp:13
#, fuzzy
msgid "&Dante"
msgstr "gebruik dante"

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "This will force KDE to use Dante if it can be found."
msgstr "hierdie sal forseer kde aan gebruik dante as dit kan wees gevind."

#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "Additional library search paths"
msgstr "aditionele biblioteek soektog paths"

#: rc.cpp:16
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Here you can specify additional directories to search for the SOCKS "
"libraries. /usr/lib, /usr/local/lib, /usr/local/socks5/lib and "
"/opt/socks5/lib are already searched by default."
msgstr ""
"hier jy kan spesifiseer aditionele gidse aan soektog vir die socks "
"biblioteke.  /   usr   /    lib    , /   usr   /plaaslike/    lib    , /   "
"usr   /plaaslike/socks5/    lib     en /opt/socks5/    lib     word alreeds "
"gesoekte deur verstek."

#: rc.cpp:17
msgid "Path"
msgstr "gids soeklys"

#: rc.cpp:18
msgid "This is the list of additional paths that will be searched."
msgstr "hierdie is die lys van aditionele paths wat sal wees gesoekte."

#: rc.cpp:19
msgid "&Add"
msgstr "voeg by"

#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "&Test"
msgstr "toets"

#: rc.cpp:22
msgid "Click here to test SOCKS support."
msgstr "kliek hier aan toets socks ondersteun."

#: socks.cpp:88
msgid "These changes will only apply to newly started applications."
msgstr "hierdie verander sal slegs wend aan aan nuwe beginne programme."

#: socks.cpp:90 socks.cpp:123 socks.cpp:128
msgid "SOCKS Support"
msgstr "socks ondersteun"

#: socks.cpp:122
msgid "Success!  SOCKS was found and initialized."
msgstr "sukses!  socks was gevind en geinitialiseer word."

#: socks.cpp:127
msgid "Sorry, SOCKS could not be loaded."
msgstr "jammer, socks kon nie wees gelaai."

#: socks.cpp:265
msgid ""
"<h1>SOCKS</h1>"
"<p>This module allows you to configure KDE support for a SOCKS server or "
"proxy.</p>"
"<p>SOCKS is a protocol to traverse firewalls as described in <a "
"href=\"http://rfc.net/rfc1928.html\">RFC 1928</a>. "
"<p>"
"If you have no idea what this is and if your system administrator doesn't "
"tell you to use it, leave it disabled.</p>"
msgstr ""

